WEBVTT

00:07:59.808 --> 00:08:03.729
and they can go in to show the AI
what tears in the fabric look like

00:08:03.771 --> 00:08:05.564
by drawing rectangles.

00:08:05.606 --> 00:08:08.025
And they can also go in to show the AI

00:08:08.067 --> 00:08:10.486
what discoloration
on the fabric looks like

00:08:10.528 --> 00:08:12.029
by drawing rectangles.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:13.864
So these pictures,

00:08:13.864 --> 00:08:16.450
together with the green
and pink rectangles

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:17.743
that the inspector's drawn,

00:08:17.785 --> 00:08:20.371
are data created by the inspector

00:08:20.412 --> 00:08:23.999
to explain to AI how to find
tears and discoloration.

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:26.835
After the AI examines this data,

00:08:26.877 --> 00:08:29.421
we may find that it has seen
enough pictures of tears,

00:08:29.463 --> 00:08:31.840
but not yet enough pictures
of discolorations.